---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Field notes
eyebrow: Blog / reverse chronological
description: Dispatches about making, owning and tending a small place on the web.
permalink: /blog/
---
<ol class="post-list">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        <span class="post-list__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>
